<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-743] DictionaryFilters can re-use StreamBytesInput when compressed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-743</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When using an And or Or DictionaryFilter, we re-use the BytesInput across reads. This is problematic when compressed because compressed BytesInputs get converted over to StreamBytesInputs which can only be used once.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13010555">PARQUET-743</key>
            <summary>DictionaryFilters can re-use StreamBytesInput when compressed</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
